<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fair Isaac lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fair Isaac lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Fair Isaac &amp; Co Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
